# @last-edited: 2026-10-05 11:50 UTC+7.
# @title: .vercelignore — keep deploy-only files out of the upload.
# @state: the site is served as static files; AGENTS.md is repo governance, not a page.
# @dependencies: none stated.

# WHY this file exists: an auto-detected framework replaced the root document, so the alias served 404 while the deployment URL served a dashboard.
# These three lines, plus framework null in vercel.json, keep the site static.

.vercel
.env*
AGENTS.md